---
description: Avoid build or recompilation commands unless requested
alwaysApply: true
---

# Recompilation

- Do not run `cmake --build`, `ninja`, direct compiler commands, or other recompilation/build commands unless the user explicitly asks.
- It is still okay to run read-only checks, searches, lint diagnostics, or formatting/whitespace checks that do not compile code.
- If verification would normally require a build, mention that it was skipped because no rebuild was requested.
